<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka's Three H1 net falls sharply.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka's Three H1 net falls sharply.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for the first six months of the financial year to June 30, 1996 of Three Acre Farms Ltd.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			 H1 1996	H1 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	  83.07   vs   105.39</p>
<p>    Net profit	 0.02   vs    37.53</p>
<p>    Tax		  0.20   vs    12.86</p>
